# L720 backlog and ideas

## Completed today

* Fixed Android Google Maps integration in the Expo dev build and resolved the React Maps API key/native config issues.
* Restored working map rendering in the mobile app and added ticket pin interaction.
* Added map quick-view ticket cards with ticket number, address, contractor info, contractor phone, work type, due date, and locator status.
* Added default active-ticket map focus behavior for `ONSITE` / `ENROUTE` tickets and cleaner map-card animation behavior.
* Fixed stale-ticket removal so reassigned or deleted tickets are removed from the mobile board without requiring a full app restart.
* Added backend reconciliation so stale tickets removed from 811 are also removed from the L720 backend.
* Added mobile auto-sync polling so newly assigned tickets and removals propagate to the tech board automatically.
* Improved sync behavior so pull-to-refresh and clock-related sync paths are more reliable.
* Consolidated mobile ticket parsing/presentation helpers and cleaned up ticket detail, ticket card, map view, and customer-tab code.

